description.narrative:
The overall objective of the Basket Fund is to support the GoK in its efforts to transform the NPS into an effective, efficient and trusted security agency for Kenyans in line with the Constitution of Kenya 2010. 

The Community Policing component will contribute to this objective by apprising to achieve the following; 
•Community policing approaches and processes, aligned with the National Community Policing Policy, implemented in up to ten police stations areas in three to four counties., 
•County Policing Authorities in three to four counties provided with packages and resource materials to replicate and cascade community policing roll-out to all police stations in the counties;
•Community policing methods included in the national curriculum for basic police training.
